      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SMS Calendar Assistant\nTriggered by an incoming text to your Twilio number.\nReply \"tomorrow\" -> texts back tomorrow's agenda.\nReply \"week\" -> texts back the next 7 days.\nReply \"add: <event>\" -> Claude/Anthropic parses it and creates a Google Calendar event, then confirms by text.\nAnything else -> gets a help text.\nWhen you reconnect your second Google Calendar, add it to the Tomorrow/Week/Create Event branches too.",
